-and axiom-clean**: it is read off the *torsion-pole* transfer `ord_P (mulByInt_x ℓ) = -2`,
-`ord_P (mulByInt_y ℓ) = -3` (the simple zeros of `ψ_ℓ` at the `ℓ`-torsion points), supplied here by
